      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1774196080476,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- In microservices, services or component instances are created and deleted dynamically.\n- We can not hardcode the URL of a particular instance, its not scalable and feasible.\n- If there is only one instance then hardcoding URL makes sense, otherwise it will not work.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 93,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- In microservices, services or component instances are created and deleted dynamically.\n- We can not hardcode the URL of a particular instance, its not scalable and feasible.\n- If there is only one instance then hardcoding URL makes sense, otherwise it will not work.\n",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
